            "stem": "Buyout Capital, LLC, is a private equity fund that has the following \n\nLearning Module 2\t\nAlternative Investment Performance and Returns\n60\ncharacteristics:\n\t\n■\nCapital committed: $200 million\n\t\n■\nPreferred return: 8% soft hurdle, with full catch-up\n\t\n■\nFund distribution: after five years\n\t\n■\nManagement fee: none\n\t\n■\nCarried interest: 20% above preferred return\n\t\n■\nWaterfall structure: European (whole of fund)\nThe fund made five investments that are tabulated as follows:\nInvestment \nNo.\nYear\nAmount ($ m)\nProfit\nInvested\nSold\nInvested\nSold\n$ m\n%\n1\n0\n4\n40\n60\n20\n10.67%\n2\n0\n4\n40\n100\n60\n25.74%\n3\n1\n5\n40\n50\n10\n5.74%\n4\n1\n5\n40\n120\n80\n31.61%\n5\n2\n5\n40\n30\n(10)\nneg.\nTotal\n \n \n200\n360\n160\n12.47%\nWhat is the total carried interest to the GP?",
