            "solution_explanation": "C is correct. Strategic investors typically join in at early-stage to later-stage \nfinancing. A is incorrect because founders are typically part of the investor group \nat the earliest, pre-seed stage. B is incorrect because angel investors are typically \ninvolved in the beginning stages, either pre-seed or seed."
