            "stem": "Which of the following parties is responsible for the portfolio management of a \nfund of hedge funds?",
            "options": {
              "A": "Accredited investor",
              "B": "General partner",
              "C": "Limited partner"
            },
            "correct_answer": "B",
            "solution_explanation": "B is correct. The general partner is responsible for choosing the hedge funds in \na fund of hedge funds. A and C are incorrect because they refer to customers or \ninvestors in the fund."
