            "solution_explanation": "A is correct. The Dee family effectively owns 24% of the timber and forest assets. \nThey own 30% of the shares of DAG (the publicly traded corporation), and they \nown 80% of the limited partnership (which owns the assets): 24% = 30% × 80%."
