            "stem": "A fund had the following returns over the past 10 years:\nYear\nReturn\n1\n4.5%\n2\n6.0%\n3\n1.5%\n4\n−2.0%\n5\n0.0%\n6\n4.5%\n7\n3.5%\n8\n2.5%\n9\n5.5%\n10\n4.0%\nThe difference between the arithmetic and geometric mean returns over the 10 \nyears is closest to which of the following?",
