            "q_num": 1,
            "stem": "At the beginning of Year 1, a fund has EUR100 million under management; it \nearns a return of 14% in Year 1. The fund attracts another net USD400 million at \nthe start of Year 2 and earns a return of 8% in Year 2. The fund's money-weighted \nrate of return is:",
